  "content": {
    "id": "p6-q11-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "11",
    "prompt": "All variables take positive values. Given that $m\\propto n^5$, what is the effect on:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p6-q11a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$m$ when $n$ is doubled?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$m$ is multiplied by $32$.",
          "worked": "Since $m=kn^5$, replacing $n$ by $2n$ gives:\n$$\\begin{align*}m_{\\text{new}}&=k(2n)^5\\\\m_{\\text{new}}&=32kn^5\\\\m_{\\text{new}}&=32m\\end{align*}$$\nThus, $m$ is multiplied by $32$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 29
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q11b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$m$ when $n$ is halved?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$m$ is multiplied by $\\frac{1}{32}$.",
          "worked": "Since $m=kn^5$, replacing $n$ by $\\frac n2$ gives:\n$$\\begin{align*}m_{\\text{new}}&=k\\left(\\frac n2\\right)^5\\\\m_{\\text{new}}&=\\frac{kn^5}{32}\\\\m_{\\text{new}}&=\\frac m{32}\\end{align*}$$\nThus, $m$ is divided by $32$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 35
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q11c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$n$ when $m$ is multiplied by $243$?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$n$ is tripled.",
          "worked": "Let $f$ be the factor multiplying $n$. Since $m=kn^5$, the factor multiplying $m$ is $f^5$.\n$$\\begin{align*}f^5&=243\\\\f^5&=3^5\\\\f&=3\\end{align*}$$\nThus, $n$ is tripled.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 35
      },
      {
        "id": "p6-q11d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$n$ when $m$ is divided by $1024$?",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$n$ is divided by $4$.",
          "worked": "Let $f$ be the factor multiplying $n$. Since $m=kn^5$, the factor multiplying $m$ is $f^5$.\n$$\\begin{align*}f^5&=\\frac{1}{1024}\\\\f^5&=\\left(\\frac14\\right)^5\\\\f&=\\frac14\\end{align*}$$\nThus, $n$ is divided by $4$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 41
      }
    ]
  },
